function FilterBar({cats,filter,onPick}){const ref=useRef(null),[canL,setCanL]=useState(false),[canR,setCanR]=useState(false);const update=()=>{const el=ref.current;if(!el)return;setCanL(el.scrollLeft>4);setCanR(el.scrollLeft<el.scrollWidth-el.clientWidth-4)};useEffect(()=>{update();const t=setTimeout(update,120);window.addEventListener('resize',update);return()=>{clearTimeout(t);window.removeEventListener('resize',update)}},[cats,filter]);const nudge=d=>{const el=ref.current;if(el)el.scrollBy({left:d,behavior:'smooth'})};return <div className="filters-bar">{canL&&<button className="filter-arrow left" aria-label="Scroll filters left" onClick={()=>nudge(-340)}><ChevronLeft size={18}/></button>}<div className="filters" ref={ref} onScroll={update}>{cats.map(c=><button className={filter===c?'active':''} onClick={()=>onPick(c)} key={c}>{c}</button>)}</div>{canR&&<button className="filter-arrow right" aria-label="Scroll filters right" onClick={()=>nudge(340)}><ChevronRight size={18}/></button>}</div>}
function useIsMobile(q='(max-width:640px)'){const[m,setM]=useState(()=>typeof window!=='undefined'&&!!window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia(q).matches);useEffect(()=>{const mq=window.matchMedia(q);const on=e=>setM(e.matches);mq.addEventListener('change',on);setM(mq.matches);return()=>mq.removeEventListener('change',on)},[q]);return m}
function Preloader({exiting}){const[prog,setProg]=useState(0),[face,setFace]=useState(true);const name='NEHAL AGGARWAL';useEffect(()=>{const t0=performance.now(),dur=1300;let raf;const tick=t=>{const p=Math.min(100,Math.round((t-t0)/dur*100));setProg(p);if(p<100)raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick)};raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);return()=>cancelAnimationFrame(raf)},[]);return <div className={'preloader'+(exiting?' exiting':'')}><div className="preloader-grid"/><div className="preloader-core"><div className="preloader-ring"><div className="preloader-logo">{face?<img src="/profile-photo.png?v=20260917" alt="" onError={()=>setFace(false)}/>:<span>NA</span>}</div></div><div className="preloader-name">{name.split('').map((c,i)=><span key={i} style={{animationDelay:`${0.2+i*0.04}s`}}>{c===' '?'\u00A0':c}</span>)}</div><div className="preloader-sub">Final-Year MBBS · Medical Writer</div><div className="preloader-bar"><span style={{width:prog+'%'}}/></div><div className="preloader-meta"><span className="preloader-pct">{prog}%</span><span className="preloader-hint">Preparing experience</span></div></div></div>}
function CountUp({value}){const[display,setDisplay]=useState(value);const ref=useRef(null);useEffect(()=>{const m=String(value).match(/^([\s\S]*?)(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)([\s\S]*)$/);if(!m){setDisplay(value);return}const[,pre,num,suf]=m,target=parseFloat(num),el=ref.current;if(!el)return;let started=false;const obs=new IntersectionObserver(es=>{es.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting&&!started){started=true;const dur=1400,t0=performance.now();const tick=t=>{const p=Math.min(1,(t-t0)/dur),eased=1-Math.pow(1-p,3);setDisplay(pre+Math.round(target*eased)+suf);if(p<1)requestAnimationFrame(tick)};requestAnimationFrame(tick);obs.disconnect()}})},{threshold:.35});obs.observe(el);return()=>obs.disconnect()},[value]);return <b ref={ref}>{display}</b>}
